{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>《Mortgage Payment Calculator》適合正計劃置業或為現有物業再融資的用戶，可根據貸款金額、利率與年期計算每月房貸還款額；原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-67.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>精準計算每月房貸</h2>\n<p>開啟 App 後，只需輸入貸款金額、利率及貸款年期，應用便會顯示每月還款金額，計算結果可精確至每一分。無論是規劃置業預算，還是評估為現有物業再融資後的供款變化，都可快速掌握實際支出，方便比較不同貸款方案。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-116-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-117-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-118-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1290x2796bb-119-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1181\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Mortgage Payment Calculator</li><li>應用類別：Finance</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/mortgage-payment-calculator/id633008351?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T11:54:45.487152+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":267,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:35:31+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T17:38:32.990067+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T11:51:43.037908+00:00","content_hash":"bc9080853a4dd45463d8bc60dd64fe69d3dd589c022868546f2d4eb18a7dd962","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}